OL,3,GNEWSA'I felt like a criminal after shop
OL,4,Ascan mistake'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs supermarkets step up security
OL,7,Fmeasures to tackle shoplifting, one
OL,8,Fcustomer said repeated basket checks in
OL,9,Fstore left him feeling embarrassed,
OL,10,Fparanoid and that he was being treated
OL,11,Flike a criminal.
OL,13,FChris Shaw said he was repeatedly
OL,14,Fselected for rescans after forgetting
OL,15,Fto scan a packet of tissues while using
OL,16,FSainsbury's SmartShop service at a
OL,17,Fstore in Leamington Spa.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
