OL,3,GNEWSA'I felt like a criminal after shop
OL,4,Ascan mistake'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlthough staff reassured him at the
OL,7,Ftime that the mistake had been
OL,8,Fresolved, Shaw said he was repeatedly
OL,9,Fstopped for checks in the months that
OL,10,Ffollowed.
OL,12,F"I thought I was going crazy," he said.
